    "sections": {
        "description": "The AI Services Theme is a modern, responsive, and feature-rich website solution designed for AI startups, machine learning companies, automation services, chatbot providers, data analytics firms, robotics businesses, SaaS platforms, and technology consultants. Built with a clean and professional layout, it helps showcase innovative AI solutions, services, case studies, pricing plans, client testimonials, and team members in a visually engaging way. The fully responsive design ensures your site looks great on desktops, tablets, and mobile devices, while customization options let you personalize colors, fonts, banners, and layouts without coding. Optimized for fast loading, SEO-friendly structure, and smooth navigation, it enhances user experience and online visibility. Social media integration, call-to-action sections, contact forms, and translation readiness make it easy to connect with a global audience. Whether you're promoting AI-powered tools, intelligent automation, predictive analytics, or digital transformation services, this theme provides a reliable foundation for creating a professional online presence with ease."
    },
